      "Language": "jpn",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We commenced a new trial of an incorporated round visit. Members of round visit are 4 anesthesiologists and 2 pharmaceutists. This new trial gives us the following advantages; 1. We can get the newest drug informations at bed side during the round visit. 2. We can select a more reasonable therapy for patients through discussions. 3. Cooperative development of clinical studies concerning a new model or style of drugs may be possible. This new style of round visit is also of benefit for patients because it leads to administration of more pertinent drugs. We recommend to have a chance of cooperation between anesthesiologists and pharmaceutists in other hospitals."},
